Dear Adventurers of Astella,

Here you will find a list of fixes that address the following issues in the update 1.5.229.7:

- Added a borderless windowed mode in the display option;
- Improved Quest Logs so they are easier to read;
- Improved Torii's Status Page, now Torii's two combat styles share the same trinket and snack load-outs;

Buffs for Torii's Floating Leaf-style

- The Time-Stop attack will now automatically launch daggers toward the location of the mouse cursor. 
For controllers, the daggers will automatically lock onto the nearest enemy;
- Full Salvo (Available at Level 12): Now attacks also apply marks of psychoblades;
- “Command: Protect”: Now restores HP for Sid.

We have been hard at work behind the scenes - more tune-ups and contents are under active development. Please stay tuned!

The Development Team
Mar. 15, 2023

Dear Adventurers of Astella,

Happy to announce that the Digital Art Book and OST for Souls of Chronos are now available on Steam.

https://store.steampowered.com/bundle/30973/_/
In addition, a digital deluxe edition, which includes the digital art book, the ost, and the game itself, has been made available for purchase at a 10% discount.

Souls of Chronos Digital Art Book  includes:

Character designs;
Environment designs;
Overworld concept arts and designs;
Concept art and designs for Calm Waves Square;
Concept art and designs for Sewers;
Concept art and designs for Land Corals;
Concept art and designs for Redwood.

*How to access the digital artbook:
Once purchased and downloaded, it will automatically be put into the default file directory of the game. Right-click on the game in your Steam library, click on "Manage", then select "Browse Local Files", to conveniently access the pdf file.

Souls of Chronos OST contains a total of 13 tracks featured in the game. Please visit the product page for a complete tracklist.

As always, thank you for your continued support!

The Development Team
Mar. 4, 2023

Dear Adventurers of Astella,

Here you will find a list of fixes that address the following issues in the update 1.5.228.1:

- Updated the UI for Story Stats resets at the Black Market Vendor, making it easier to access and understand;
- Fixed the issue where certain events were not being triggered as intended.
- Fixed an issue where unlocking Secret Passage earlier than expected would prevent the main storyline from progressing;
- Further extended the availability for certain side quests in Chapter 1;
- Added a prompt to remind players before entering the story path that would lead to the Bad Ending.

Additionally, the road map for future updates has been announced earlier. Please check it out if you haven't got the time to do so! If you have any feedback or suggestions about the plan or the gameitself, please do not hesitate to let us know!

The Development Team
February 27, 2023
